        "original_id": "9aff9dba-1d66-5609-9a48-b4fa8fd06534",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Regency Road, Adelaide; Klemzig, South Australia; Dudley Park, South Australia; Adelaide\n- Organizations: Adelaide College of Ministries\n- Products: Arndale Shopping Centre\n- Roads: Muller Road; North East Road; Simpson Avenue; Harrison Road\n- Systems: Adelaide-Gawler railway line\n\nFacts:\n- Regency Road in Adelaide is located about 6 km north of the city centre.\n- Regency Road runs from Arndale Shopping Centre in Kilkenny in the west to Broadview in the east.\n- Regency Road continues east as Muller Road and ends at North East Road in Klemzig.\n- Klemzig is a suburb of Adelaide in the City of Port Adelaide Enfield.\n- Dudley Park is bordered on the north by Regency Road, on the south by Simpson Avenue, on the east by the Adelaide-Gawler railway line, and on the west by a north-south line from the Harrison Road-Simpson Avenue intersection to Regency Road.\n- Adelaide College of Ministries is located in Klemzig in Adelaide, South Australia.",
